  "limitations": [
    "All four installations are retained qualification fixtures on the same existing two-vCPU Linux arm64 Docker VM on one physical Mac, with 21 unrelated QA containers running. There are no existing user installations.",
    "Backup pauses background work before stopping. Restored due and pending-retry occurrences remain held through explicit possible-loss acknowledgment. Resume schedules future work; this trial does not demonstrate completion of the old retry after restore.",
    "The older snapshot deliberately lacks results acknowledged after it was taken. Recovery acknowledgment warns about possible loss or replay of external effects. No exactly-once external-effect guarantee follows.",
    "The first attempt failed because the probe used native process existence as a readiness check. The new probe verifies approved native data before admin observation. The failed attempt remains unaccepted, stopped and retained.",
